    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "If the lady from the Viennese painting “The Kiss” were depicted going to town on a traditional Viennese dessert...",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "Chaque baiser commence avec Klimt ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "722088_1",
      "n": "CategoryAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "OU\nMort par un dessert chocolaté au café. ",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio3"
    },
    {
      "s": "Si vous avez déjà été dans une résidence universitaire, vous savez que Gustav Klimt a peint « Le baiser », mais je suis presque sûr qu’il n’a rien peint qui s’appelle « L’appel téléphonique du lendemain » ou « L’engagement réel envers cette relation ». ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "722089_1",
      "n": "IntroAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "722091_1",
      "n": "ChoicesAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Je ne connais pas l’art, mais je reconnais une mauvaise réponse quand j’en vois une. (Tous) ",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio2"
    },
    {
      "s": "OR\nNon, mais c'est un dessert très impopulaire à l'Olive Garden. ",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio1"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Sachertorte is a decadent chocolate cake that was invented by Franz Sacher in Vienna. And it’s just fun to say. Sachertorte!!",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "722093_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "In the end, chocolate will never break your heart.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "722094_3",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "If the lady from the Viennese painting “The Kiss” were depicted going to town on a traditional Viennese dessert, what would that painting of her eating her Viennese feelings be called?",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "722090_2",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
    }
